{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Five runners completed the grueling Xmarathon: Luke, Melina, Nico, Olympia, and Pedro.\n</p><p>Nico finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes behind Pedro.\nOlympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes ahead of Melina, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes behind Pedro.\nOlympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes ahead of Luke.\n</p><p>Which runner finished fourth?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb5cfcc10122f37f2737b93f35e772548bcbc9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{Luke} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\text{Melina} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\text{Nico} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\text{Olympia}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{Pedro}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"532\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the respective places be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/74970e7a267e0680eed3fcb1186e7f632d03050c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = 11+N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/0/e905fe6a9eab55010d53a88d6bb8f3241a1df26e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O-2 = M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/1/b6104b97c566d8182587295c1150fdbba87f1d25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O+3 = P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b21ffd00dc9f416eb271dbda838e9bddd0ba8f18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = 6+L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />. Then, substitution for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4ae216c8656e7735bf421a88c3f2981e6011247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O+3 = N+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"16\" />, in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b422f8283c9961794efdadec94f3141e5ae08895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O=N+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/7/5371c0290f49f1e19163c49de8ee939e78617081.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+6 = M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/d/84dda3e77b48b78fb58a1d2557a6019e2ea8764e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+8=6+L \\Rightarrow N+2=L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"230\" height=\"16\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> finished m minutes behind everyone (that was ok), and thus was last.\n</p><p>Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9b2cb47b9c2de7a515108eaa96d764b1cf38694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O=6+L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805b21b07448216f1410fc69fb6bfaf3eaed93e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L+9 = P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db61315fc57fc71a6f66c848d9bc300eb3b4a1d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L+7 = M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9ce0951f82114b33559d71b208eadd3776932b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{Luke}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"48\" height=\"25\" /> finished fourth.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, as Nico, Pedro, Olympia, Melina, and Luke's times in the marathon, respectively. Fix <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> somewhere. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and if we draw this out, we have that Pedro is 1st, and Nico is 2nd right now. Adding in Olympia, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that the current standings is that Pedro is 1st, Olympia is 2nd, and Nico is 3rd. Adding in Melina, because she is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after Olympia, she is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than Pedro, meaning that the current standings are Pedro is 1st, Olympia is 2nd, Melina is 3rd, and Nico is 4th. Finally, adding in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, we have our final standings, which is Pedro at 1st, Olympia at 2nd, Melina at 3rd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb1b9bd9f13acd8921f6bc77ffb7057f36962eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\text{Luke}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" /> at 4th, and Nico at 5th. ~Baihly2024\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nico finished 11 minutes behind Pedro, so we could have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15f49370bdf40ed81089f39bb4e10c1c7fd1a66d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$NP=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> in the following diagram:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf255839a83c2f33d8e83f7850a7934b97d3fcf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(11,0)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, (0,0), N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, (11,0), N); dot((0,0)); dot((11,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"28\" />\nOlympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes ahead of Melina, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes behind Pedro, so we could have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/5058be98582155d6c48389b063acb9eccc33609c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MO=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a32ca4330a3d8c9d2c94a37eb22ba6085c0e9753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OP=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> in the following diagram:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9633163674253d790ad951928ae1cf27c0303d13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(11,0)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, (0,0), N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, (11,0), N); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, (6,0), N); label(&quot;$O$&quot;, (8,0), N); dot((0,0)); dot((11,0)); dot((6,0)); dot((8,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"28\" />\nOlympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes in front of Luke, so we could have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4f5c95f99e4df64e53fc95e24645cf53536769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LO=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> in the following diagram:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37c6ae1b601158046ce3d9fd9b6302e4fe9e7b55.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(11,0)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;, (0,0), N); label(&quot;$P$&quot;, (11,0), N); label(&quot;$M$&quot;, (6,0), N); label(&quot;$O$&quot;, (8,0), N); label(&quot;$L$&quot;, (2,0), N); dot((0,0)); dot((11,0)); dot((6,0)); dot((8,0)); dot((2,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"28\" />\nTherefore, we can see clearly that point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, or Luke, was in fourth place. Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb1b9bd9f13acd8921f6bc77ffb7057f36962eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\text{Luke}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Firstly, with logic, we can deduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144d7d598b58c33cf1de66cd4722913fee1783ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${Pedro}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> finished first. Therefore, we can use Pedro as a benchmark. In the question, it was given Olympia finished 3 minutes after Pedro. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454a8340f23cf95afa32794b48c3a8e18f431e5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = P - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" />. Next, it is also given Nico finishes 11 minutes after Pedro, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bcdbc220895d30021ec3a277dfed29110e615d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = P - 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />. The question also says that Olympia finished 6 minutes before Luke, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1968d11a7ddef8fec1b11750ed1afa67e92149.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L = P - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, because Olympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after Pedro, and Luke finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes after Olympia. Finally, the question states that Olympia finished <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes ahead of Melina, so using the same logic as Luke's case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae4f1e82b8d2ce54998e309c1fa1e09338f327e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = P - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Now that we have all times in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, we can sort them out by greatest to least. First is obviously Pedro, second is Olympia (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/e/38e363328e9e3cfbb804d45d968aab1af0534aa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />), third is Melina (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/baf3fcb5b2e6536c8185d381e7548ba034850254.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />), fourth is Luke (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/f/0bfe7ebe0f97786c21d0c30247b7e6891db5692a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />), and lastly we have Nico with (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a3e1e294945c6aa572e397847037df901f169f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P - 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />). Therefore, our answer to the problem is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb1b9bd9f13acd8921f6bc77ffb7057f36962eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\text{Luke}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />.\n~Ingeniouspeacock36\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7Jd6dA72Fp4\">https://youtu.be/7Jd6dA72Fp4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=916s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3GmtxMC-W1I&amp;t=916s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_.28AIME_Qualifier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UVME6REac/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UVME6REac/</